  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Puffer Finance is a broader Ethereum infrastructure protocol suite. Its current product families include Liquid Restaking for ETH/restaking exposure, UniFi as a based rollup/L2 product, Puffer Preconf as an EigenLayer-based preconfirmation service, and Puffer Institutional for staking/restaking infrastructure. Any vault, reward-management, token/governance, bridge, or UniFi-related contract surfaces should be scoped explicitly to these product families or excluded with rationale.",
    "relationship_narrative": "Puffer Stake's PufferVaultV5 interacts with Puffer Vaults' BoringVault and AccountantWithRateProviders to manage staked ETH and distribute rewards. Puffer UniFi's BoringVault may share similar infrastructure for restaking operations.",
